{"lines": ["A policeman watched an egg-shaped object take off, and it left burned bushes behind.", "April nineteen sixty-four, Socorro, New Mexico. Officer Lonnie Zamora is chasing a speeding car.", "He hears a roar and sees a blue flame. He fears a dynamite shack exploded, and drives toward it.", "But in a gully sits a shiny object on legs, with two figures in white beside it.", "Then it roars, rises, and speeds away.", "Minutes later, a sergeant finds four fresh dents and burned brush, cold to the touch.", "The Air Force finds no radiation, no propellant, and no vehicle. Project Blue Book marks it Unknown.", "A college president later claimed a student hoax, with no proof. Was it a prank, or a machine nobody could find in the desert?"], "words": [["A", 0.0, 0.06], ["policeman", 0.06, 0.44], ["watched", 0.44, 0.84], ["an", 0.84, 1.22], ["egg-shaped", 1.22, 1.66], ["object", 1.66, 2.24], ["take", 2.24, 2.56], ["off,", 2.56, 2.88], ["and", 3.22, 3.28], ["it", 3.28, 3.36], ["left", 3.36, 3.52], ["burned", 3.52, 3.92], ["bushes", 3.92, 4.28], ["behind.", 4.28, 4.8], ["April", 5.449, 5.7], ["nineteen", 5.7, 6.105], ["sixty-four,", 6.105, 6.56], ["Socorro,", 7.36, 8.0], ["New", 8.18, 8.26], ["Mexico.", 8.26, 8.68], ["Officer", 9.4, 9.62], ["Lonnie", 9.62, 10.16], ["Zamora", 10.16, 10.64], ["is", 10.64, 10.92], ["chasing", 10.92, 11.2], ["a", 11.2, 11.54], ["speeding", 11.54, 11.78], ["car.", 11.78, 12.24], ["He", 12.72, 12.84], ["hears", 12.84, 13.08], ["a", 13.08, 13.26], ["roar", 13.26, 13.5], ["and", 13.5, 13.8], ["sees", 13.8, 14.04], ["a", 14.04, 14.26], ["blue", 14.26, 14.44], ["flame.", 14.44, 14.82], ["He", 15.4, 15.5], ["fears", 15.5, 15.84], ["a", 15.84, 16.04], ["dynamite", 16.04, 16.7], ["shack", 16.7, 16.9], ["exploded,", 16.9, 17.54], ["and", 17.54, 17.88], ["drives", 17.88, 18.16], ["toward", 18.16, 18.5], ["it.", 18.5, 18.82], ["But", 19.27, 19.38], ["in", 19.38, 19.5], ["a", 19.5, 19.6], ["gully", 19.6, 19.94], ["sits", 19.94, 20.22], ["a", 20.22, 20.44]